<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aida still in talks, advises caution.</title>
<headline>Aida still in talks, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Aida Holdings Ltd on Monday advised shareholders that negotiations are still in progress which, if successfully concluded, may have an effect on the share price of the company.</p>
<p>It said shareholders should continue exercising caution in their dealings in Aida ordinary shares until a further announcement.</p>
<p>Aida issued an earlier cautionary announcement on July 9.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
